  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The free body diagram for the given scenario is shown below-</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c9011b60-eb82-4711-b999-e2db146ea818-9896627_2.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 317px;\" /></p><p>From the equilibrium of the vertical component of forces, it can be written that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>N</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>From the equilibrium of horizontal component of forces, it can be written that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Substitute the expression for the normal reaction force from equation (1) into equation (2) and solve to calculate the value of the applied force.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>F</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>200</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>F</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>F</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>200</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8776;</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>25</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
